:: Fishing Forest Lake Catch
<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>

<<if _canEatFish>>
	It's such a small fish, you could probably fit the whole thing in your mouth.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [["Stow the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " away"|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>>
	<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
	<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
	<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
	<<endevent>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Throw it back|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
<<if _canEatFish>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Forest Lake Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Cut
<<effects>>
You <span class="purple">cut</span> the line and the $fishingHookedFish.type swims away into the depths.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "cut">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Snapped
Your line goes taut, then <span class="red">snaps.</span> The $fishingHookedFish.type is gone.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "lineSnapped">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Fish Too Far
The $fishingHookedFish.type reaches the end of your line, works the hook loose, and is <span class="red">gone</span>.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "fishOffHook">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Pulled In
The $fishingHookedFish.type pulls harder. Your feet <span class="red">slip</span> on the wet rock and you are dragged you into the lake, though you keep hold of your rod as you go under.<<gstress>><<stress 4>>
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "pulledIn">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[Next|Lake Depths]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
